project BenchArith
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1

entry console main

error MainError
errorCase MainError ConsoleWriteFailed CSignedInt32

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main read clock.cpu
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
memory main stack max 4KiB
async main no

purpose operation main "Pure-codegen benchmark with a Fibonacci-style data-dependency chain; each iteration depends on the previous two values so the loop cannot be folded"
invariant operation main "Each iteration performs exactly one addition and two register-to-register moves"

label startMain

storage module immutable iterationLimit I64 200000000
storage module immutable iterationStep I64 1
storage module immutable fibonacciInitialPreviousValue I64 1
storage module immutable fibonacciInitialCurrentValue I64 1

memory main mutable currentIteration I64 0
memory main mutable fibonacciPreviousValue I64 fibonacciInitialPreviousValue
memory main mutable fibonacciCurrentValue I64 fibonacciInitialCurrentValue

call startClockCall c.clock
run startClockCall
bind value startClockTicks CCpuClockTicks startClockCall

label arithLoopHead

call shouldContinueCmpCall math.lessThanI64
argument shouldContinueCmpCall left I64 currentIteration
argument shouldContinueCmpCall right I64 iterationLimit
run shouldContinueCmpCall
bind value arithShouldContinue Bool shouldContinueCmpCall
branch if condition arithShouldContinue target arithLoopBody
branch else target arithFinished

label arithLoopBody

# next = a + b
call fibonacciAdvanceCall math.addI64
argument fibonacciAdvanceCall left I64 fibonacciPreviousValue
argument fibonacciAdvanceCall right I64 fibonacciCurrentValue
run fibonacciAdvanceCall
bind value fibonacciNextValue I64 fibonacciAdvanceCall

# a = b
set memory fibonacciPreviousValue fibonacciCurrentValue
# b = next
set memory fibonacciCurrentValue fibonacciNextValue

# i = i + 1
call incrementCall math.addI64
argument incrementCall left I64 currentIteration
argument incrementCall right I64 iterationStep
run incrementCall
bind value nextIteration I64 incrementCall
set memory currentIteration nextIteration
jump target arithLoopHead

label arithFinished

call endClockCall c.clock
run endClockCall
bind value endClockTicks CCpuClockTicks endClockCall

call elapsedTicksCall math.subtractI64
argument elapsedTicksCall left CCpuClockTicks endClockTicks
argument elapsedTicksCall right CCpuClockTicks startClockTicks
run elapsedTicksCall
bind value elapsedClockTicks I64 elapsedTicksCall

storage module immutable reportFormatText CNullTerminatedByteString "iterations=%lld accumulator=%lld clockTicks=%lld\n"
call reportCall c.printf
argument reportCall format CNullTerminatedByteString reportFormatText
argument reportCall iterations I64 iterationLimit
argument reportCall accumulator I64 fibonacciCurrentValue
argument reportCall ticks I64 elapsedClockTicks
run reportCall
ignore void source reportCall
bind error reportError CSignedInt32 reportCall
branch error source reportCall target reportWriteFailed

storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode

label reportWriteFailed
makeError reportWriteFailure MainError.ConsoleWriteFailed reportError
return error reportWriteFailure
